# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
# Cargo.lock is committed: this workspace ships binary crates (stt-build, etc.)

# Node — this repo has no packages, only the .mjs gates in scripts/
node_modules/
.npm/
.pnp.*

# IDEs
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store

# Logs and scratch
*.log
logs/
temp_eval/
evaluation/
/scratch-*/

# Secrets / local env. The root .env holds R2 credentials; .local files hold
# per-machine secrets. Committed, non-secret config (*.example templates) is
# allowed.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.r2
rclone.conf

# Tile files. Built archives are large and are published to R2, never committed.
*.stt
# Exception: the conformance vectors are the reader's portable oracle and are
# deliberately small (~570 KB) so a third-party reader can vendor them.
!conformance/vectors/**
*.sttb
*.mbtiles
*.pmtiles

# Build artifacts
*.wasm
pkg/

# Data — never commit datasets; they live on R2 or are regenerated by
# scripts/data-generation.
#
# `data-fleet/` is the BUILT archive fleet (~76 GB, ~205 stems) that r2-sync.sh
# publishes; it was examples/showcase/public/data until the 2026-08-26 split
# moved the showcase out. `data/` is generator input. Both are large and both
# are reproducible; neither belongs in git.
data-fleet/
data-fleet-*/
data/
raw/
processed/
*.geojson
*.csv
*.parquet
*.tle
*.zip
*.arrow
*.feather
*.ipc
*.tsv
*.ndjson
*.jsonl
*.fgb
*.gpkg
*.shp
*.shx
*.dbf
*.prj
*.cpg
*.tif
*.tiff
*.geotiff
*.nc
*.nc4
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.npy
*.npz
*.las
*.laz
*.gz
scripts/data-generation/data/

# Python virtualenvs for the data-generation extractors (large; recreated per
# the per-extractor venv convention, never committed).
scripts/data-generation/venv-*/
scripts/data-generation/.venv-*/
scripts/data-generation/__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/

# OSRM routing data (large binary files)
scripts/data-generation/osrm-data/
*.osm.pbf
*.osrm
*.osrm.*

# Raw Argoverse 2 sensor logs staged for the AV-cockpit extractor (~1 GB/log;
# re-downloaded from the public s3://argoverse bucket, deleted after each build).
scripts/data-generation/av2-raw/

# Cosmos-Drive-Dreams working cache for the /worlds gallery (per-clip label tars
# from Hugging Face + intermediate parquet + phase markers; several GB, deleted
# by the generator's `cleanup` phase and re-fetchable at any time).
scripts/data-generation/cosmos-raw/

# Raw Waymo Open Dataset sensor shards staged for the AV-cockpit extractor.
# The sibling av2-raw/ and cosmos-raw/ trees are ignored by name but this one
# was not — it only escaped by accident, because every leaf happens to be a
# `.parquet`. Waymo's terms forbid REDISTRIBUTION, so a single non-parquet file
# landing here (a stats .json, a .tfrecord) must never become committable.
scripts/data-generation/waymo-raw/

# OSM editing-history inputs for `stt-generate osm-edits` (large; downloaded
# as a prerequisite, never committed). History extracts + the changeset dump.
*.osh.pbf
*.osm.bz2
*.osm.opl

# Loose root-level fixtures that occasionally appear during dev
/test*.stt
/rebuild-*.sh

# Local MCP server config (machine-specific absolute paths). The MCP server
# itself ships from the poopdeck.gl repository; a config here would point at a
# checkout that no longer exists.
/.mcp.json

.claude/
.pnpm-store/
